                <pb facs="0269" n="169" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg169"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/24150: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at
                        Manzanillo</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Walsh</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-06-03T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 3, 1920—6
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Department concurs in suggestion made in latter part your May 30, 5 P.M.,
                    regarding non-acceptance Huerta’s invitation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
